            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "ae2d22556c0b9bab8d5a4995c47134288a2a978b7fa00d4b7e008c23c55b6145",
            "start": 85,
            "end": 251,
            "quote": "昇腾离线推理的动态 shape 通过 **ATC 编译时分档（gearing）** 实现：转换 OM 模型时把动态维度标记为 `-1`，再用 `--dynamic_batch_size` / `--dynamic_image_size` / `--dynamic_dims` 指定若干档位；运行时用 ACL 接口在执行前选中某一档。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-29",
            "event_id": "WebFetch_2_d8d458fc.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "1dbda79994cfe9002a751af9a7dc3f2f052e69f37cbfe143fd6b10ca7758152f",
            "start": 605,
            "end": 1384,
            "quote": "该参数需要与[--input_shape](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/850/devaids/atctool/atlasatcparam_16_0016.html)、[--input_format](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/850/devaids/atctool/atlasatcparam_16_0015.html)配合使用，不能与[--dynamic_batch_size](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/850/devaids/atctool/atlasatcparam_16_0018.html)、[--dynamic_image_size](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/850/devaids/atctool/atlasatcparam_16_0019.html)、[--input_shape_range](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/850/devaids/atctool/atlasatcparam_16_0017.html)、[--insert_op_conf](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/850/devaids/atctool/atlasatcparam_16_0044.html)同时使用。",
            "json_escaped": false
          }
